ctions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> </span>\n- <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> a bomb that explodes on impact\n</p>\n<dl><dd><ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 4 m (13 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 4 m (13 ft) Radius</li>\n<li><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/31px-D4_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/46px-D4_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/62px-D4_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/31px-D4_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/D4_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">3d4 + 9 (12~21)  <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></span> </div> damage</li>\n<li>Inflicts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2 turns</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;12 Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;12 <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> to halve all damage, and negate silenced</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Silenced\"> Condition: Silenced </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Silenced\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Silenced_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Silenced_(Condition)\" title=\"Silenced (Condition)\">Silenced</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Creature can't speak or cast spells with a verbal component, and is immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Rewarded by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/25px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/38px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/50px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Barcus Wroot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png/25px-Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Portrait_Barcus_Wroot.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_Wulbren\" title=\"Rescue Wulbren\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"rescuing Wulbren\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_Wulbren\" title=\"Rescue Wulbren\">rescuing Wulbren</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item is unique, and cannot be bought or crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Brilliant Retort triggers the same scripting as a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Smokepowder_Bomb\" title=\"Smokepowder Bomb\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/GRN_Smokepowder_Bomb_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Smokepowder_Bomb\" title=\"Smokepowder Bomb\">Smokepowder Bomb</a> does, which results in a second instance of damage being dealt when thrown or destroyed for a total of <div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/31px-D4_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/46px-D4_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/62px-D4_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/D4_Force.png/31px-D4_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/D4_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">6d4 + 18 (24~42)  <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></span> </div> damage. This same scripting can also result in multiple instances of damage being triggered when the grenade object is destroyed by an attack with multiple damage sources. See <a href=\"/wiki/Smokepowder_Bomb#bugs\" title=\"Smokepowder Bomb\">Smokepowder Bomb#bugs</a> for additional.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202220\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.115 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.121 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4874/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 63148/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18531/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 30/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1292866/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   94.869      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   94.869      1 -total\n 49.32%   46.794     59 Template:Trim\n 47.36%   44.927     17 Template:Icon_text\n 23.44%   22.233      9 Template:Icon_link\n 18.14%   17.205      1 Template:PageSeo\n 18.06%   17.136      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.50%   14.701     19 Template:Ifempty\n 12.09%   11.468      3 Template:Uid\n 11.95%   11.338      2 Template:SAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:14018-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202220 and revision id 386566. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}